@startuml
' The tidy version of charging: wait for the chain, then write. On a slow
' minute it refuses a reader whose charge then lands.
' Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-tidy-charge-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> S : POST the article
S -> C : send the charge
S -> C : poll the signature, up to 20 s
... the chain is slow ...
S --> B : $wrong("no article")
hnote over C : $wrong("the charge lands")

note over B, C
  The reader has paid, and has nothing to show
  for it. The refusal was already on the screen
  when the charge landed.
end note
@enduml
